 "text": " SEARCH\n MANAGE MY BOOKINGS\nLIST YOUR VENUE\n HOME\n LOGIN\n SIGN UP\n BECOME A VENUE PARTNER\n\nChoose a sport and search by location or venue\n\nSelect a sport\nFIND VENUE\n\nList your venue 🏫 Connect your sport facilities with your local communities! Learn more »\n\n Explore nearby venues\nBurgess Park Non-Partner \nFootballTennisCricket\nGET IN TOUCH\nLocation, Opening Hours and Prices\n Click to interact with the map\n\n Burgess Park, Albany Road, Old Kent Road, Southwark, SE5 0AH\n\nPrices\n\nFootball 11-a-side £178.20 / hour\n\nPublic Transport\n\n Oval\n\nOpening Hours\nMonday\t10:00-22:00\nTuesday\t10:00-22:00\nWednesday\t10:00-22:00\nThursday\t10:00-22:00\nFriday\t10:00-22:00\nSaturday\t09:00-20:00\nSunday\t09:00-20:00\nDescription\n\nBurgess Park has one 11 a side football pitch on a 3G Astroturf surface for hire. It is located in Southwark, South London and the nearest tube is Oval. The facilities are available on pay as you play basis.\n\n Football Pitches\n11 a side | 3G Astroturf5 a side | 3G Astroturf\nFacilities\n floodlights changing rooms free parking\nMAKE A BOOKING\n Book Online at our Nearby Partner Venues\nLifestyle Fitness Epsom\nEpsom\n\n 11.5 miles away\n\nCoombe Wood School\nSouth Croydon\n\n 8.3 miles away\n\nBeaumont School\nHertfordshire\n\n 20.8 miles away\n\nFeel Good Too (formerly Ive Farm Fields)\nLondon\n\n 6.2 miles away\n\nSouthfield Road Playing Fields\nLondon\n\n 7.5 miles away\n\nPLAYFINDER FOR SPORTS VENUE OPERATORS\nWhether you're a council, school, community group or leisure centre, becoming a Playfinder Partner can benefit your sports venue in number of ways\nOnline Bookings\nWe enable venues to take online bookings, resulting in increased booking conversion rates and revenue\nFIND OUT MORE\nMarketing Expertise\nBenefit from Playfinder marketing campaigns giving your venue increased exposure\nFIND OUT MORE\nOperational Support\nWe manage all email and phone enquiries, as well as invoices and block booking waiting lists\nFIND OUT MORE\nTHE BEST EMAILS IN THE GAME\nSIGN UP\nQUICK LINKS\n\nFind what you’re looking for in a flash\n\nPlayfinder\nAbout us\nIn the press\nApp\nBlog\nCareers\nContact us\nTerms and conditions\nPrivacy policy\nSitemap\nBOOK SPORTS FACILITIES\n\nFind a facility in your city\n\nBirmingham\nBradford\nBrighton\nDublin\nLeeds\nLeicester\nLondon\nLuton\nManchester\nNottingham\nRest of the UK\nSouthampton\nFOR SPORTS VENUE OPERATORS\nIncrease exposure with Playfinder\n\nGet listed on the UK's leading facility booking marketplace which has helped millions find somewhere to play sport. We will help you fill spare capacity and reach a new audience\n\nManage bookings with Bookteq\n\nBookteq is the complete facility booking software for operators such as councils, schools and sports clubs. Manage real-time bookings, payments and customers with our market leading service\n\nCOMMUNITY\n\nWhat we’re doing to improve the world of sport\n\nSupporting Grassroots Projects\nEVENTS\n\nOrganise events and hire space\n\nCorporate events\nFilming at sports facilities\nStadium hire\nBubble football\n SECURE PAYMENTS\n\nAll payments are processed securely through Stripe\n\n           \nGET THE APP\n #SportMadeSimple © All Rights Reserved 2026\nYour consent preferences for tracking technologies",
